WEBVTT

00:01:47.820 --> 00:01:52.420
=Light of Dawn=
(Support Admin Watch on
kissasia.cam or kisskh.org)

00:01:56.420 --> 00:01:59.620
(Day of the Penglai Plaza crash)

00:02:01.200 --> 00:02:03.319
Hello, Ms. Hong.

00:02:03.719 --> 00:02:05.079
Gao Feng and I have arrived.

00:02:06.000 --> 00:02:07.280
We are seated by the window.

00:02:09.800 --> 00:02:10.319
Okay.

00:02:28.879 --> 00:02:29.560
Su.

00:02:29.879 --> 00:02:31.000
Didn't I tell you

00:02:31.000 --> 00:02:33.360
I was trying
to find Gao Feng's birth mother?

00:02:33.560 --> 00:02:35.759
Didn't you warn me about scammers?

00:02:36.159 --> 00:02:38.879
I think I really ran into one today.

00:02:39.400 --> 00:02:42.120
I already gave her the money.
One hundred thousand.

00:02:42.599 --> 00:02:44.120
Okay. I won't move. I won't.

00:02:44.280 --> 00:02:45.520
I'll send you the address.

00:02:45.560 --> 00:02:46.520
Hurry over.

00:02:47.280 --> 00:02:48.080
And Su,

00:02:49.280 --> 00:02:50.560
bring a few more people with you.

00:02:51.039 --> 00:02:53.319
That woman seems a bit unstable.

00:02:53.759 --> 00:02:55.360
The way she talks isn't normal.

00:02:55.520 --> 00:02:57.120
Bring more people and detain her.

00:04:01.919 --> 00:04:02.560
Hello.

00:04:02.919 --> 00:04:04.960
Are you not looking for Qu Meng?

00:04:06.840 --> 00:04:09.240
You will see her very soon.

00:04:16.439 --> 00:04:17.160
That's impossible.

00:04:17.240 --> 00:04:22.319
Back then, you buried
Gao Feng's birth mother yourself.

00:04:22.480 --> 00:04:23.160
I didn't know.

00:04:23.160 --> 00:04:24.279
Didn't know,

00:04:25.160 --> 00:04:26.360
or didn't dare to know?

00:04:26.360 --> 00:04:27.439
I didn't know.

00:04:28.480 --> 00:04:31.160
Why wouldn't you let Gao Feng
look for his birth mother?

00:04:33.759 --> 00:04:36.160
Why wouldn't you let Gao Feng
apply to the police academy?

00:04:36.680 --> 00:04:37.720
All these years,

00:04:38.040 --> 00:04:39.480
even for a single second,

00:04:40.959 --> 00:04:43.079
if you hadn't kept lying to yourself,

00:04:43.560 --> 00:04:45.439
it would never have come to this.

00:04:49.220 --> 00:04:53.580
(Late 1990s
Penglai Plaza)

00:04:56.959 --> 00:04:59.360
Stop dragging your feet. Move it.

00:05:05.879 --> 00:05:07.920
Gao, let's stop this.

00:05:12.020 --> 00:05:13.120
Hey. You stop right there.

00:05:13.120 --> 00:05:13.519
You!

00:05:13.600 --> 00:05:14.990
Gao Dahua, what are you staring at?

00:05:15.040 --> 00:05:15.720
Move faster.

00:05:16.079 --> 00:05:17.160
You're the only one left.

00:05:17.160 --> 00:05:18.660
Even if it's just you,
you're finishing the job.

00:05:20.000 --> 00:05:21.480
Stop right there. Do not run.

00:05:58.200 --> 00:05:59.040
This is all my fault.

00:05:59.240 --> 00:06:00.040
I was wrong.

00:06:00.240 --> 00:06:01.480
I did not know it was Qu Meng.

00:06:01.480 --> 00:06:04.319
I only wanted
to avoid dying at their hands.

00:06:04.879 --> 00:06:06.160
I never thought it would be her.

00:06:06.519 --> 00:06:08.079
I never imagined it was really her.

00:06:08.560 --> 00:06:10.319
Please do not let Gao Feng find out.

00:06:10.319 --> 00:06:11.360
It is already too late.

00:06:12.360 --> 00:06:14.439
The stone statue has been smashed open.

00:06:15.000 --> 00:06:17.199
The police
will start investigating soon.

00:06:17.680 --> 00:06:20.720
Gao Feng will find out sooner or later.

00:06:22.319 --> 00:06:24.519
Everything about his birth mother.

00:06:29.240 --> 00:06:30.120
I deserve to die.

00:06:31.920 --> 00:06:32.879
I will kill myself.

00:06:33.959 --> 00:06:34.800
I will kill myself.

00:06:36.040 --> 00:06:39.000
Can I trade my life for Qu Meng's?

00:06:40.680 --> 00:06:42.680
Death will not let you off that easily.

00:06:45.040 --> 00:06:46.199
What we are involved in

00:06:48.600 --> 00:06:52.680
cannot be settled just by dying.

00:06:59.639 --> 00:07:00.439
If I die,

00:07:00.759 --> 00:07:01.600
once I am dead,

00:07:01.720 --> 00:07:03.480
the police will not be able
to keep digging.

00:07:05.040 --> 00:07:06.480
For my wife and my son,

00:07:07.160 --> 00:07:09.199
you will just be a fraud.

00:07:10.160 --> 00:07:12.240
Those things had nothing to do with me.

00:07:12.879 --> 00:07:13.600
Ms. Hong.

00:07:14.000 --> 00:07:15.390
I have been a coward my whole life.

00:07:15.800 --> 00:07:17.240
I only want my wife and son

00:07:17.720 --> 00:07:19.199
to live a steady, peaceful life.

00:07:19.600 --> 00:07:20.560
Following me,

00:07:21.720 --> 00:07:22.920
they have suffered enough.

00:07:23.480 --> 00:07:25.839
Please do not drag them into this.

00:07:26.160 --> 00:07:28.399
We were all too weak.

00:07:28.959 --> 00:07:32.240
If we had even half
of Qu Meng's resolve,

00:07:35.000 --> 00:07:38.759
none of us
would be living like this today.

00:07:40.120 --> 00:07:41.279
You agree, right?

00:07:42.319 --> 00:07:42.959
Ms. Hong.

00:07:44.240 --> 00:07:45.319
You agree, right?

00:07:45.879 --> 00:07:46.959
Then it is settled.

00:07:48.000 --> 00:07:48.759
I will die.

00:07:49.560 --> 00:07:50.920
I will die right now.

00:07:51.000 --> 00:07:52.519
All of us deserve to die.

00:07:54.319 --> 00:07:55.759
All of us.

00:08:06.639 --> 00:08:09.160
We should have died long ago.

00:08:12.700 --> 00:08:16.380
=Episode 17=
=Reunion=

00:08:36.400 --> 00:08:38.320
- Who is a family member of Zhang Jing?
- I am.

00:08:39.560 --> 00:08:41.390
- How is she?
- A mild cerebral infarction.

00:08:41.400 --> 00:08:42.840
Fortunately, she was brought in early.

00:08:42.840 --> 00:08:43.720
No surgery is needed.

00:08:45.500 --> 00:08:47.990
It is best to stay hospitalized
for observation for a few days.

00:08:50.000 --> 00:08:51.639
- Go register and pay the fees.
- Okay. Thank you, doctor.

00:08:51.639 --> 00:08:52.930
- You are welcome. It is my duty.
- Thank you.

00:08:57.080 --> 00:08:58.279
Do you know why

00:08:58.279 --> 00:09:00.960
I never liked using an insulin pump?

00:09:03.039 --> 00:09:04.159
All these years,

00:09:05.960 --> 00:09:07.519
I just wanted you to take care of me.

00:09:07.519 --> 00:09:09.080
The moment when you gave me injections,

00:09:09.919 --> 00:09:11.600
even if it was only for a short while,

00:09:12.159 --> 00:09:13.200
in my eyes,

00:09:13.600 --> 00:09:14.919
you will always be

00:09:14.919 --> 00:09:17.240
that obedient and sensible little girl.

00:09:19.039 --> 00:09:19.759
Feifei.

00:09:21.120 --> 00:09:22.840
Do not become like your mother.

00:09:24.879 --> 00:09:26.320
Do not follow her path.

00:09:30.120 --> 00:09:32.120
After years of senseless turmoil,

00:09:34.039 --> 00:09:38.039
it tore this family apart
between life and death.

00:09:41.919 --> 00:09:43.840
We are already separated
by life and death.

00:09:45.840 --> 00:09:46.840
You always say

00:09:48.279 --> 00:09:49.559
I carry your blood.

00:09:52.120 --> 00:09:53.639
But I carry my mother's blood.

00:09:55.800 --> 00:09:57.639
Are you not afraid
that for my mother's sake,

00:09:57.639 --> 00:09:58.960
I will come after you?

00:10:02.039 --> 00:10:03.600
You have lived half your life

00:10:03.799 --> 00:10:05.240
hiding everything away.

00:10:06.120 --> 00:10:08.120
To be honest, I actually pity you.

00:10:09.800 --> 00:10:11.990
You have spent your whole life
running from the truth.

00:10:12.919 --> 00:10:14.399
Killing to silence others.

00:10:14.639 --> 00:10:15.840
Destroying evidence.

00:10:19.679 --> 00:10:20.799
You ungrateful child.

00:10:21.480 --> 00:10:23.480
Everything I did was for you.

00:10:24.360 --> 00:10:25.879
I have lived half my life

00:10:26.399 --> 00:10:27.639
calculating every step.

00:10:28.000 --> 00:10:29.919
I calculated everything,

00:10:30.000 --> 00:10:32.600
except that the one who would report me
to the Public Security Bureau

00:10:32.600 --> 00:10:33.960
would be my own daughter.

00:10:35.080 --> 00:10:37.480
I fought my whole life

00:10:37.480 --> 00:10:38.919
against people out there

00:10:38.919 --> 00:10:39.960
who wanted me dead.

00:10:39.960 --> 00:10:41.039
I competed nonstop

00:10:41.159 --> 00:10:42.879
to build all of this.

00:10:43.759 --> 00:10:45.080
And it was all for you.

00:10:45.519 --> 00:10:48.440
Yet a flimsy confession letter

00:10:48.519 --> 00:10:52.360
made you and Yang come after me,

00:10:53.600 --> 00:10:56.600
seeing me as some monster
who kills to silence others

00:10:57.919 --> 00:11:00.039
and destroys evidence.

00:11:02.159 --> 00:11:02.960
Feifei.

00:11:03.679 --> 00:11:05.440
Thirty years ago, Binchuan

00:11:05.440 --> 00:11:08.200
meant nothing to me.

00:11:11.120 --> 00:11:12.480
It was only because of you

00:11:12.840 --> 00:11:14.240
that I finally had roots.

00:11:17.039 --> 00:11:18.120
Because of you,

00:11:20.279 --> 00:11:21.960
I stayed in this city.

00:11:30.279 --> 00:11:31.240
Love is love.

00:11:33.799 --> 00:11:34.840
Crime is crime.

00:11:37.679 --> 00:11:39.000
They do not cancel each other out.

00:11:47.320 --> 00:11:47.960
Dad.

00:11:49.639 --> 00:11:50.679
Turn yourself in.

00:11:52.679 --> 00:11:54.639
I will go with you
to the Public Security Bureau.

00:11:55.720 --> 00:11:57.639
We will tell them everything.

00:11:58.600 --> 00:12:00.240
No matter how it ends,

00:12:00.240 --> 00:12:02.240
I am still your daughter.

00:12:05.720 --> 00:12:06.519
Otherwise...

00:12:07.200 --> 00:12:09.360
Otherwise, whatever we had
as father and daughter

00:12:14.480 --> 00:12:16.600
may truly come to an end.

00:12:39.559 --> 00:12:41.320
Gao Feng is my child.

00:12:41.399 --> 00:12:43.000
He is my son, Zhang Jing's son.

00:12:44.440 --> 00:12:45.519
I am sorry, Mom.

00:12:46.159 --> 00:12:48.799
I was digging into my own past
and dragged you into it.

00:13:20.559 --> 00:13:23.399
You really are just like the old man.

00:13:25.080 --> 00:13:27.080
Both of you are stubborn to the end,

00:13:27.679 --> 00:13:28.720
even when it is obvious.

00:13:29.799 --> 00:13:32.159
You claim you are not doing it
for each other,

00:13:33.000 --> 00:13:35.240
yet you cannot stop worrying
about one another.

00:13:36.279 --> 00:13:39.200
You still care about this family.

00:13:41.840 --> 00:13:42.879
Come home.

00:13:43.840 --> 00:13:44.559
All right?

00:13:54.120 --> 00:13:56.639
The Technical Appraisal Center
confirmed that Uncle Gao's video

00:13:56.640 --> 00:13:58.440
and the footage Xu Zhiyang
previously submitted,

00:13:58.440 --> 00:13:59.720
the video of Xu Peng
committing the crime,

00:13:59.720 --> 00:14:00.990
are actually the same recording.

00:14:01.200 --> 00:14:02.600
It was just split into two parts.

00:14:03.000 --> 00:14:04.880
What we obtained earlier
was the first segment.

00:14:05.639 --> 00:14:08.559
As for Uncle Gao's case,
I will get to the bottom of it.

00:14:10.399 --> 00:14:13.039
Aunt Zhang may not
have known everything either.

00:14:15.120 --> 00:14:16.250
That does not matter anymore.

00:14:19.200 --> 00:14:21.559
How is Wu Feifei doing now?

00:14:22.120 --> 00:14:24.320
We have not been able
to reach her at all.

00:14:25.120 --> 00:14:26.240
Her phone will not connect,

00:14:26.600 --> 00:14:28.159
and their house is shut tight.

00:14:28.160 --> 00:14:29.200
We have people watching it.

00:14:30.480 --> 00:14:31.639
What matters most right now

00:14:32.399 --> 00:14:34.720
is that we need to protect Wu Feifei
as soon as possible.

00:14:37.840 --> 00:14:40.840
My only real memory from childhood

00:14:41.039 --> 00:14:43.000
is my mother telling me

00:14:43.159 --> 00:14:45.000
that if I ever felt lonely,

00:14:45.500 --> 00:14:47.399
I should listen to the sounds
inside the statue.

00:14:49.039 --> 00:14:51.160
You were there when the fire happened,
were you not?

00:14:52.279 --> 00:14:53.480
Do I resemble my mother?

00:14:54.600 --> 00:14:55.639
Probably not.

00:14:56.879 --> 00:14:58.240
If I did,

00:14:58.600 --> 00:15:00.679
if she truly saw me as her daughter,

00:15:01.690 --> 00:15:03.120
she would not have been so ruthless.

00:15:07.000 --> 00:15:07.639
Do me a favor.

00:15:08.559 --> 00:15:10.240
Help me check where Wu Feifei went

00:15:10.559 --> 00:15:11.519
after the attic fire.

00:15:12.200 --> 00:15:13.879
(Binchuan Public Security Bureau Data Center)
Pull all surveillance footage related to this vehicle.

00:15:14.519 --> 00:15:15.080
Stop.

00:15:18.200 --> 00:15:20.679
Gao Feng,
after reviewing the surveillance,

00:15:21.200 --> 00:15:22.600
Wu Feifei and Wu Guohao

00:15:22.600 --> 00:15:24.480
went to her mother's
cemetery together once,

00:15:24.770 --> 00:15:26.200
and later she went there alone again.

00:15:27.240 --> 00:15:28.320
As for what she did there,

00:15:28.330 --> 00:15:29.799
we have not been able
to determine it yet.

00:15:29.799 --> 00:15:30.860
(Beloved Wife, Li Hongyue)

00:15:32.399 --> 00:15:33.039
I know.

00:15:34.279 --> 00:15:35.080
To say goodbye.

00:15:36.720 --> 00:15:38.080
To say goodbye to her childhood.

00:15:38.420 --> 00:15:41.759
(Beloved Wife, Li Hongyue)

00:15:41.759 --> 00:15:43.440
These are your mother's belongings.

00:15:45.480 --> 00:15:46.840
How would you like to handle them?

00:15:47.559 --> 00:15:48.960
That is for you to decide.

00:15:51.000 --> 00:15:53.159
Ms. Wu, based on the latest leads,

00:15:53.240 --> 00:15:54.559
we need to conduct

00:15:54.559 --> 00:15:55.440
a DNA test.

00:15:55.799 --> 00:15:57.759
Please come back to the bureau with us
and assist with the investigation.

00:16:07.320 --> 00:16:09.679
All right, I will go with you.

00:16:36.279 --> 00:16:37.080
What are you doing?

00:16:37.900 --> 00:16:39.759
Are you hitting someone
in front of the police?

00:16:39.760 --> 00:16:41.610
Believe it or not,
I can take you in right now.

00:16:42.480 --> 00:16:43.600
Officer Su.

00:16:43.840 --> 00:16:44.919
Thank you for your concern.

00:16:44.919 --> 00:16:45.960
This is not assault.

00:16:45.960 --> 00:16:47.799
It is our unique corporate culture.

00:16:50.440 --> 00:16:51.159
A little pat,

00:16:51.159 --> 00:16:52.320
to keep people clear headed.

00:16:52.679 --> 00:16:53.480
Thank you, Mr. Wu.

00:16:56.519 --> 00:16:57.320
Wu Guohao.

00:16:58.639 --> 00:17:00.039
I am formally notifying you now

00:17:00.040 --> 00:17:01.950
that you may not leave Binchuan
for the time being.

00:17:01.960 --> 00:17:03.399
If it is confirmed
that the woman in the attic

00:17:03.399 --> 00:17:04.599
is your wife, Hongyue,

00:17:04.960 --> 00:17:07.160
we will proceed in accordance
with the law immediately.

00:17:07.720 --> 00:17:09.160
I am not going anywhere.

00:17:10.920 --> 00:17:13.599
Please investigate this thoroughly

00:17:14.640 --> 00:17:15.680
and clear my name.

00:17:23.200 --> 00:17:24.640
- This way.
- Officer Su, take care.

00:17:28.240 --> 00:17:29.079
Feifei.

00:17:43.279 --> 00:17:43.920
Dad.

00:17:47.720 --> 00:17:48.519
I am leaving now.

00:17:51.480 --> 00:17:52.599
Take care of yourself.

00:19:36.599 --> 00:19:38.839
Based on the deductions
made by Gao Feng and Wu Feifei,

00:19:39.000 --> 00:19:41.359
everything Hongyue did
after returning to Binchuan

00:19:41.359 --> 00:19:43.160
seems she was guiding them, step by step

00:19:43.160 --> 00:19:45.799
to question and investigate
their own origins.

00:19:46.000 --> 00:19:48.799
Following this line of thinking,
we discovered a sequence of numbers

00:19:48.799 --> 00:19:50.290
inside both spherical pieces
of evidence.

00:19:50.519 --> 00:19:51.279
After examination,

00:19:51.759 --> 00:19:54.480
We believe this string of numbers
represents latitude and longitude.

00:19:55.039 --> 00:19:56.359
They point precisely

00:19:56.359 --> 00:19:57.960
to the stone lion at Penglai Plaza.

00:19:59.240 --> 00:20:00.079
However,

00:20:00.839 --> 00:20:02.839
the victim could not
have known in advance

00:20:03.000 --> 00:20:05.519
that she would be buried
beneath the statue.

00:20:05.519 --> 00:20:08.359
So when she left behind these numbers,

00:20:08.359 --> 00:20:11.400
could they have meant something else?

00:20:12.279 --> 00:20:13.759
After the statue was struck open,

00:20:14.039 --> 00:20:15.079
we carried out

00:20:15.079 --> 00:20:17.319
routine excavation
and investigation in the area.

00:20:17.640 --> 00:20:18.559
So far,

00:20:19.599 --> 00:20:21.279
we have found no other suspicious leads.

00:20:22.279 --> 00:20:24.480
We will expand the search,
both in scope and in depth.

00:20:24.640 --> 00:20:26.000
Since these numbers

00:20:26.000 --> 00:20:27.960
clearly point to Penglai Plaza,

00:20:28.039 --> 00:20:29.690
we will comb
the entire place thoroughly.

00:20:29.799 --> 00:20:30.319
Understood.

00:20:38.119 --> 00:20:38.880
Thank you.

00:20:40.480 --> 00:20:41.519
The DNA test results

00:20:41.519 --> 00:20:42.480
will be ready shortly.

00:20:42.860 --> 00:20:44.119
What are you thinking right now?

00:20:44.519 --> 00:20:45.480
I am thinking about

00:20:48.119 --> 00:20:52.160
what went through your mind
when you learned

00:20:54.079 --> 00:20:55.390
that your mother was buried there.

00:20:58.119 --> 00:20:58.799
During that time,

00:20:58.799 --> 00:21:01.240
I often camped overnight at the plaza.

00:21:01.680 --> 00:21:03.119
Sometimes people out on morning runs

00:21:03.119 --> 00:21:04.640
mistook me for a homeless person.

00:21:06.200 --> 00:21:07.519
But honestly, those were

00:21:07.519 --> 00:21:09.100
the best nights of sleep I had in years.

00:21:11.400 --> 00:21:12.960
I felt especially close to my mom.

00:21:13.759 --> 00:21:16.079
Sometimes family and blood ties

00:21:16.680 --> 00:21:17.519
are just like that.

00:21:19.119 --> 00:21:21.039
There is an invisible thread
between them,

00:21:22.480 --> 00:21:24.680
one that never truly breaks.

00:21:26.119 --> 00:21:27.440
Maybe it was fate.

00:21:30.480 --> 00:21:32.200
How can all of this
be such a coincidence?

00:21:32.240 --> 00:21:35.799
Once the truth is fully uncovered,
your life may change completely.

00:21:36.759 --> 00:21:37.359
Are you afraid?

00:21:39.599 --> 00:21:40.319
I was.

00:21:44.279 --> 00:21:45.480
Because of that fear,

00:21:47.440 --> 00:21:48.960
I avoided everything for far too long.

00:21:51.640 --> 00:21:53.279
So now I want to understand clearly

00:21:53.279 --> 00:21:54.359
what that thread of mine

00:21:55.640 --> 00:21:56.920
really looks like.

00:21:59.520 --> 00:22:01.279
While comparing
the biological relationship

00:22:01.279 --> 00:22:03.599
between witness Wu Feifei

00:22:03.799 --> 00:22:06.680
and the female body found in the attic,

00:22:06.690 --> 00:22:07.990
we discovered they are not related.

00:22:08.400 --> 00:22:09.400
However, unexpectedly,

00:22:09.640 --> 00:22:11.000
the DNA comparison between

00:22:11.000 --> 00:22:13.319
Wu Feifei and Gao Feng|
showed a very high match.

00:22:13.680 --> 00:22:15.440
They also share a direct biological link

00:22:15.680 --> 00:22:17.400
with the skeletal remains of Qu Meng.

00:22:19.359 --> 00:22:21.880
We have preliminarily determined
that Gao Feng and Wu Feifei

00:22:21.880 --> 00:22:24.559
are fraternal twins born to Qu Meng.

00:22:30.180 --> 00:22:35.260
(Early 1990s)

00:23:14.000 --> 00:23:15.079
Boy and girl twins.

00:23:20.880 --> 00:23:21.880
Boy and girl twins.

00:23:25.960 --> 00:23:27.200
You are truly remarkable.

00:23:33.240 --> 00:23:34.319
Go to the hospital.

00:23:40.559 --> 00:23:41.640
It is too late.

00:23:44.440 --> 00:23:46.920
I know my own child.

00:23:50.799 --> 00:23:51.680
Just now...

00:23:55.480 --> 00:23:57.240
There is no way the baby can survive.

00:24:14.519 --> 00:24:16.440
Fate really plays cruel tricks.

00:24:19.960 --> 00:24:22.599
From the moment I became pregnant,

00:24:23.200 --> 00:24:25.039
I carried this child with an intention.

00:24:26.960 --> 00:24:27.960
In the end,

00:24:29.400 --> 00:24:30.920
I still could not protect him.

00:24:33.759 --> 00:24:35.200
I failed this child.

00:24:41.319 --> 00:24:42.200
I am sorry.

00:24:42.880 --> 00:24:45.839
I do not deserve
to be this child's mother.

00:24:50.640 --> 00:24:52.000
This is fate.

00:24:54.920 --> 00:24:55.920
All of it is fate.

00:24:58.160 --> 00:24:59.960
What I owe my child,

00:25:02.240 --> 00:25:03.160
in another life,

00:25:06.079 --> 00:25:08.400
I will repay slowly then.

00:25:19.119 --> 00:25:19.920
Qu Meng.

00:25:24.720 --> 00:25:25.880
Give me the girl.

00:25:26.960 --> 00:25:27.839
I will raise her.

00:25:28.960 --> 00:25:30.039
Can you really let her go?

00:25:32.200 --> 00:25:33.359
This is fate.

00:25:43.319 --> 00:25:44.240
Stop crying.

00:25:47.000 --> 00:25:47.640
From now on...

00:25:49.200 --> 00:25:51.240
From now on, we are both mothers.

00:26:07.119 --> 00:26:07.920
Names.

00:26:09.480 --> 00:26:10.680
The children's names.

00:26:12.599 --> 00:26:13.599
Have you decided?

00:26:22.160 --> 00:26:23.319
The boy will be called Feng.

00:26:26.839 --> 00:26:28.000
The girl will be called Fei.

00:26:31.279 --> 00:26:32.519
I hope that they

00:26:35.599 --> 00:26:36.839
can ride the wind

00:26:39.000 --> 00:26:40.279
and soar high.

00:27:37.640 --> 00:27:40.480
When did you first start sensing it?

00:27:44.359 --> 00:27:45.240
I do not know.

00:27:46.079 --> 00:27:47.799
To be honest, I used to think

00:27:48.960 --> 00:27:51.559
that talk about twins having

00:27:51.559 --> 00:27:52.839
some kind of telepathic bond

00:27:54.319 --> 00:27:55.759
was just psychological.

00:27:55.759 --> 00:27:56.720
I did not believe it.

00:27:57.920 --> 00:27:58.640
But

00:28:00.000 --> 00:28:01.960
once it actually happened to me,

00:28:02.680 --> 00:28:03.720
up until today,

00:28:04.880 --> 00:28:06.920
it feels like everything happening to me

00:28:08.440 --> 00:28:10.519
is somehow truly connected to you.

00:28:13.039 --> 00:28:14.599
Both of us can hear the song.

00:28:15.079 --> 00:28:16.039
That day of the fire,

00:28:20.000 --> 00:28:21.880
I actually dreamed of you.

00:28:23.240 --> 00:28:24.400
And also,

00:28:26.039 --> 00:28:29.559
you could even guess
where I hid the golden sphere.

00:28:32.200 --> 00:28:34.280
It feels like,
even before we recognized each other,

00:28:34.440 --> 00:28:36.279
there was always some unseen force

00:28:36.279 --> 00:28:37.359
pushing us forward.

00:28:38.359 --> 00:28:40.400
Back then, we just did not realize

00:28:41.519 --> 00:28:42.640
what it all meant.

00:28:43.359 --> 00:28:44.079
Yeah.

00:28:44.799 --> 00:28:47.839
I always thought that person

00:28:49.640 --> 00:28:52.319
was my only family in this world.

00:28:55.039 --> 00:28:56.720
From a bloodline perspective,

00:28:59.920 --> 00:29:01.160
I gained one more family member,

00:29:04.920 --> 00:29:06.400
but I also lost one.

00:29:12.319 --> 00:29:13.279
So my dad,

00:29:18.160 --> 00:29:19.359
so Wu Guohao...

00:29:23.559 --> 00:29:24.680
About Wu Guohao,

00:29:27.039 --> 00:29:28.759
I need some time to accept it.

00:29:34.079 --> 00:29:35.000
Me too.

00:29:36.640 --> 00:29:38.200
After everything we have been through,

00:29:39.680 --> 00:29:41.079
we should thank ourselves.

00:29:43.920 --> 00:29:46.319
We did not become the people
we once hated.

00:29:50.440 --> 00:29:51.799
And more importantly,

00:29:53.000 --> 00:29:57.440
we finally found another version
of ourselves in this world.

00:30:04.680 --> 00:30:06.680
Nice to meet you, Wu Feifei.

00:30:17.559 --> 00:30:18.960
Nice to meet you,

00:30:20.000 --> 00:30:20.960
Gao Feng.

00:30:32.160 --> 00:30:33.279
Feifei.

00:30:34.519 --> 00:30:35.519
Feng.

00:30:36.240 --> 00:30:38.119
Happy birthday.

00:30:42.519 --> 00:30:44.039
Live well.

00:30:46.680 --> 00:30:47.920
Their parents are coming back.

00:30:50.079 --> 00:30:52.079
I asked Gao Dahua
to take Zhang Jing to a movie.

00:30:54.400 --> 00:30:55.119
No need.

00:30:55.960 --> 00:30:58.000
Let us sing and blow out the candles.

00:31:01.480 --> 00:31:03.279
Time to blow out the candles.

00:31:06.119 --> 00:31:07.920
Come on, blow them out.

00:31:09.799 --> 00:31:10.880
Happy birthday.

00:31:11.079 --> 00:31:12.160
Happy birthday.

00:31:13.039 --> 00:31:15.279
Come on, blow out the candles.

00:31:28.200 --> 00:31:29.119
Let us sing a song.

00:31:29.920 --> 00:31:31.090
You should be the one singing.

00:31:32.480 --> 00:31:33.359
You should sing.

00:31:35.039 --> 00:31:36.000
I heard that

00:31:36.880 --> 00:31:38.519
for a child's first birthday,

00:31:39.000 --> 00:31:40.079
the mother sings the song.

00:31:40.559 --> 00:31:41.480
They will remember it.

00:31:43.759 --> 00:31:44.640
Feifei,

00:31:45.359 --> 00:31:47.359
let Mom sing you a birthday song, okay?

00:31:50.400 --> 00:31:51.039
Okay.

00:31:51.799 --> 00:31:52.720
I will sing it for you.

00:32:46.500 --> 00:32:47.980
The criminals were extremely cunning.

00:32:48.039 --> 00:32:50.000
They hid key evidence

00:32:50.000 --> 00:32:51.319
far deeper than we expected.

00:32:51.759 --> 00:32:54.680
This time, we discovered
two sets of female remains,

00:32:55.079 --> 00:32:56.680
the remains of two aborted infants,

00:32:56.680 --> 00:32:57.960
and one set of male remains.

00:32:58.400 --> 00:32:59.720
Based on preliminary examinations,

00:32:59.720 --> 00:33:02.559
the time of death for all these remains
predates Qu Meng.

00:33:02.560 --> 00:33:03.870
Urban construction records show

00:33:03.880 --> 00:33:06.519
that before the plaza was built,
the site was wasteland,

00:33:06.520 --> 00:33:08.300
which fits the conditions
for burying bodies.

00:33:08.330 --> 00:33:09.599
According to forensic analysis,

00:33:09.599 --> 00:33:11.599
the male victim's skull

00:33:11.599 --> 00:33:13.720
suffered blunt force trauma
before death.

00:33:13.839 --> 00:33:14.559
At the same time,

00:33:14.559 --> 00:33:16.599
we also found, among the remains,

00:33:16.599 --> 00:33:17.680
a tooth

00:33:17.680 --> 00:33:19.640
that did not belong to the victim.

00:33:19.640 --> 00:33:20.519
We believe

00:33:20.640 --> 00:33:21.559
this tooth

00:33:21.559 --> 00:33:24.240
was knocked out
during a violent collision

00:33:24.240 --> 00:33:25.640
suffered by the victim before death.

00:33:25.650 --> 00:33:27.060
The task force requests authorization

00:33:27.079 --> 00:33:29.640
to formally launch
an investigation into Wu Guohao

00:33:29.680 --> 00:33:32.490
and other suspects from Penglai Group,
and to conduct DNA comparisons.

00:33:32.759 --> 00:33:33.680
Request approved.

00:33:33.960 --> 00:33:34.440
Yes.

00:33:56.319 --> 00:33:59.200
Put a lion statue right here.

00:33:59.350 --> 00:34:01.720
Mr. Wu, this location is different
from the original plan.

00:34:01.720 --> 00:34:03.559
It will affect the entire plaza layout.

00:34:03.559 --> 00:34:05.079
Do not talk to me about planning.

00:34:05.279 --> 00:34:06.260
I am telling you, Mr. Xu,

00:34:06.270 --> 00:34:07.519
the master
has already calculated everything.

00:34:07.519 --> 00:34:08.719
(The stone lion statue coordinates)
The latitude and longitude are all set.

00:34:08.719 --> 00:34:10.920
It must be built at this exact spot.

00:34:11.159 --> 00:34:12.920
Fine, we will follow Mr. Wu's decision.

00:34:12.920 --> 00:34:13.559
Have some tea.

00:34:15.800 --> 00:34:16.880
It can go anywhere.

00:34:16.960 --> 00:34:19.000
No, it has to be right here.

00:34:20.020 --> 00:34:21.719
- It has to be. It absolutely has to be.
- Everything is marked.

00:34:21.719 --> 00:34:22.719
It was all calculated.

00:34:25.679 --> 00:34:30.559
(I never imagined that after
a lifetime of careful scheming,)

00:34:30.920 --> 00:34:33.360
(in the end, the person I trusted most)

00:34:34.180 --> 00:34:35.559
(would be the one who betrayed me.)

00:34:35.700 --> 00:34:39.860
♪There's no fruit without flowers♪

00:34:40.500 --> 00:34:42.940
♪Or rain without clouds♪

00:34:44.020 --> 00:34:46.700
♪Or fire without wind♪

00:34:48.660 --> 00:34:53.060
♪All are born amid cries♪

00:34:53.740 --> 00:34:56.580
♪Everyone laughs and dances♪

00:34:57.140 --> 00:35:00.900
♪Each one bound in chains♪

00:35:00.900 --> 00:35:06.060
♪Sinner, the shell that traps you♪

00:35:06.660 --> 00:35:09.300
♪Is also gilded♪

00:35:09.700 --> 00:35:12.940
♪How could one bear to shed it?♪

00:35:13.940 --> 00:35:19.860
♪Sufferer,
hate is a road with no return♪

00:35:19.860 --> 00:35:22.780
♪There's nothing at the end♪

00:35:22.780 --> 00:35:26.540
♪Cause and effect trade roles♪

00:35:26.940 --> 00:35:28.620
♪Unable to love♪

00:35:28.940 --> 00:35:33.380
♪Yet still leap into pavilions in air♪

00:35:33.380 --> 00:35:35.260
♪Unable to let go♪

00:35:35.260 --> 00:35:39.820
♪Still asking why♪

00:35:39.820 --> 00:35:41.660
♪Unable to ask♪

00:35:42.020 --> 00:35:46.380
♪So you trade everything for nothing♪

00:35:46.700 --> 00:35:48.220
♪Unwilling to lose♪

00:35:48.220 --> 00:35:52.020
♪You err, then err again♪

00:35:52.980 --> 00:35:54.780
♪A single person♪

00:35:54.780 --> 00:35:59.380
♪Whose cause bore whose fruit♪

00:35:59.380 --> 00:36:01.260
♪A single rain♪

00:36:01.260 --> 00:36:05.500
♪Cannot wash away good and evil♪

00:36:05.500 --> 00:36:05.940
(Confirmed as fraternal twins)

00:36:05.940 --> 00:36:07.580
♪One glance back♪

00:36:07.580 --> 00:36:12.180
♪Who is not a guest to feast and die♪

00:36:12.180 --> 00:36:15.220
♪Only then do we know at the start♪

00:36:15.220 --> 00:36:18.580
♪Why people cry♪

00:36:18.580 --> 00:36:20.620
♪A single person♪

00:36:20.620 --> 00:36:25.020
♪This life has no other river♪

00:36:25.340 --> 00:36:27.100
♪A single love♪

00:36:27.100 --> 00:36:31.700
♪A wave to the far shore♪

00:36:31.700 --> 00:36:33.620
♪One word from me♪

00:36:33.620 --> 00:36:38.220
♪Yet I don't know how to say it to you♪

00:36:38.220 --> 00:36:44.660
♪Look at the lanterns,
the years locked us in♪

00:36:44.660 --> 00:36:46.540
♪A single person♪

00:36:46.540 --> 00:36:50.740
♪Whose cause bore whose fruit♪

00:36:50.740 --> 00:36:52.860
♪A single rain♪

00:36:52.860 --> 00:36:57.500
♪Cannot wash away good and evil♪

00:36:57.500 --> 00:36:59.420
♪One glance back♪

00:36:59.420 --> 00:37:03.940
♪Who is not a guest to feast and die♪

00:37:03.940 --> 00:37:06.940
♪Only then do we know at the start♪

00:37:06.940 --> 00:37:10.260
♪Why people cry♪

00:37:10.260 --> 00:37:12.220
♪A single person♪

00:37:12.220 --> 00:37:16.900
♪This life has no other river♪

00:37:16.900 --> 00:37:18.780
♪A single love♪

00:37:18.780 --> 00:37:23.340
♪A wave to the far shore♪

00:37:23.340 --> 00:37:25.260
♪One word from me♪

00:37:25.260 --> 00:37:29.660
♪Yet I do not know how to say it to you♪

00:37:30.559 --> 00:37:31.639
Retribution.

00:37:32.159 --> 00:37:35.199
You always say you want to leave
something behind for your children.

00:37:35.519 --> 00:37:36.320
Hongyue.

00:37:36.480 --> 00:37:37.239
Qu Meng.

00:37:39.880 --> 00:37:41.679
Leaving behind a song like this.

00:37:46.360 --> 00:37:48.280
So that is what it means.

00:37:52.000 --> 00:37:53.599
Teacher Ma, have some water.

00:37:56.480 --> 00:37:57.280
Miss Qu.

00:37:57.840 --> 00:37:59.360
Let us not record Dedication today.

00:38:00.000 --> 00:38:01.990
I want to sing something
I have never sung before.

00:38:02.000 --> 00:38:03.490
Something to leave
for someone important.

00:38:03.639 --> 00:38:05.800
This backing track was not easy to find.

00:38:06.280 --> 00:38:07.480
You will have to beg me for it.

00:38:08.519 --> 00:38:09.320
I am begging you.

00:38:09.679 --> 00:38:10.679
I am joking.

00:38:12.880 --> 00:38:13.719
Bin, let us start.

00:38:21.620 --> 00:38:25.500
♪My silent lips♪

00:38:25.820 --> 00:38:29.220
♪Stained with tears♪

00:38:30.300 --> 00:38:33.820
♪No rouge ♪

00:38:33.820 --> 00:38:37.700
♪Can hide these scars♪

00:38:38.800 --> 00:38:40.580
Bring Feifei here
less often in the future.

00:38:41.280 --> 00:38:42.760
The two children are growing up.

00:38:43.199 --> 00:38:44.719
If someone recognizes them,

00:38:45.119 --> 00:38:46.119
It will be too dangerous.

00:38:47.340 --> 00:38:49.700
♪Lies meant to make amends♪

00:38:49.700 --> 00:38:51.740
♪Excuses meant to atone♪

00:38:51.740 --> 00:38:54.920
♪I won't take them seriously♪

00:38:54.920 --> 00:38:55.960
I recorded a cassette.

00:38:56.880 --> 00:38:58.880
This is the only thing
I can leave for Feifei.

00:38:59.920 --> 00:39:01.199
If one day I am no longer here,

00:39:01.719 --> 00:39:04.199
I hope my singing
can grow up with Feifei.

00:39:05.599 --> 00:39:07.039
Do you think the two of them

00:39:08.370 --> 00:39:10.310
will have a day
when they recognize each other?

00:39:15.159 --> 00:39:15.760
They will.

00:39:18.039 --> 00:39:19.360
There will definitely be that day.

00:39:21.900 --> 00:39:25.300
♪But don't use atonement as an excuse♪

00:39:26.220 --> 00:39:29.780
♪To break my heart again♪

00:39:32.960 --> 00:39:35.599
After Wu Guohao
burned the items on the outskirts,

00:39:35.599 --> 00:39:37.360
we lost his phone signal.

00:39:37.639 --> 00:39:41.039
He is clearly very familiar
with Binchuan's road surveillance system.

00:39:41.760 --> 00:39:43.239
This is the last location

00:39:43.239 --> 00:39:44.679
where he was captured on camera.

00:39:45.280 --> 00:39:47.679
After cross checking SkyNet footage
and identity data,

00:39:47.679 --> 00:39:50.679
we are certain Wu Guohao
has not left Binchuan.

00:39:52.760 --> 00:39:54.639
What about the newly
discovered male body?

00:39:55.400 --> 00:39:56.690
Has the identity been confirmed?

00:39:57.119 --> 00:39:59.719
Based on information
previously provided by Gao Feng,

00:39:59.880 --> 00:40:02.039
and combined
with the skeletal age indicators,

00:40:02.039 --> 00:40:03.719
we suspect this body belongs to

00:40:03.719 --> 00:40:05.920
Yang Wenyuan, who went missing in 1993.

00:40:06.199 --> 00:40:08.039
We are expediting DNA comparisons

00:40:08.039 --> 00:40:09.159
with Gao Feng and Wu Feifei.

00:40:09.320 --> 00:40:10.119
Also,

00:40:10.960 --> 00:40:12.559
the tooth found among the remains

00:40:12.559 --> 00:40:15.079
that does not belong to the deceased,

00:40:15.320 --> 00:40:16.079
must be

00:40:16.079 --> 00:40:18.360
matched as soon as possible
with Wu Guohao's DNA.

00:40:18.679 --> 00:40:19.199
Yes.

00:40:20.760 --> 00:40:23.440
Ensure the personal safety
of Gao Feng and Wu Feifei.

00:40:24.480 --> 00:40:25.039
Yes.

00:40:29.519 --> 00:40:31.679
Xiao Yang, once Wu Feifei
checks into the hotel,

00:40:31.680 --> 00:40:33.430
you are responsible
for her full protection.

00:40:53.159 --> 00:40:53.760
Do not move.

00:41:28.480 --> 00:41:29.519
What a pity.

00:41:30.400 --> 00:41:31.320
Such a pity.

00:41:31.400 --> 00:41:32.719
You are quite sharp.

00:41:33.360 --> 00:41:35.000
You are real talent.

00:41:36.000 --> 00:41:38.090
If he has something to say,
have him tell me himself.

00:41:39.199 --> 00:41:40.719
There are cameras everywhere now.

00:41:41.760 --> 00:41:43.280
The citywide search has already begun.

00:41:43.280 --> 00:41:44.400
There is a reward for tips.

00:41:44.600 --> 00:41:46.000
Take a guess how much you are worth.

00:41:46.860 --> 00:41:47.719
Five hundred thousand.

00:41:51.199 --> 00:41:52.199
Do you have any proof?

00:41:53.599 --> 00:41:54.880
Let me give you a heads up.

00:41:55.440 --> 00:41:58.039
On the police side, they may already
have your latest evidence.

00:41:58.040 --> 00:42:00.470
You used Xu Peng to take the fall
for the restaurant incident.

00:42:00.480 --> 00:42:03.559
You buried the murders
beneath the statue.

00:42:04.280 --> 00:42:05.760
But do you really think you have won?

00:42:10.519 --> 00:42:11.239
Chen Kang.

00:42:12.440 --> 00:42:13.360
Give him the phone.

00:42:13.360 --> 00:42:14.320
Yes, Mr. Wu.

00:42:18.840 --> 00:42:20.840
I know I cannot get away anymore.

00:42:21.639 --> 00:42:22.800
But still,

00:42:23.760 --> 00:42:26.599
there are things I want to
say to you and the girl.

00:42:28.119 --> 00:42:30.599
Chen Kang will tell you
the time and place.

00:42:30.600 --> 00:42:32.430
If you have anything to say,
say it to the police.

00:42:32.440 --> 00:42:34.039
Do you really not want to know

00:42:34.039 --> 00:42:37.000
how your biological father,
Yang Wenyuan,

00:42:37.880 --> 00:42:39.440
actually died?

00:42:40.880 --> 00:42:42.159
Do you not want to know?

00:42:43.000 --> 00:42:44.639
Just you and the girl.

00:43:20.500 --> 00:43:23.070
♪For an answer♪

00:43:23.320 --> 00:43:25.610
♪You stand guard alone outside the door♪

00:43:27.320 --> 00:43:29.990
♪The obsession held within is sharp♪

00:43:30.280 --> 00:43:33.100
♪It cuts through everything,
leaving no way back♪

00:43:34.340 --> 00:43:36.950
♪Cobwebs are woven into a net♪

00:43:36.950 --> 00:43:39.590
♪Each strand is a lead♪

00:43:41.300 --> 00:43:46.180
♪Fate hangs above your head
like a suspended blade♪

00:43:48.320 --> 00:43:50.920
♪You swallow so much frustration♪

00:43:51.090 --> 00:43:53.510
♪And push the door open
with your own hands♪

00:43:55.270 --> 00:43:57.800
♪What's meant to come will always come♪

00:43:58.100 --> 00:44:00.990
♪You stop the pendulum of hesitation♪

00:44:02.200 --> 00:44:04.820
♪Only when darkness admits it is dark♪

00:44:04.820 --> 00:44:07.540
♪Can innocence return to the light♪

00:44:09.100 --> 00:44:11.760
♪The curtain of the truth
is drawn aside♪

00:44:11.760 --> 00:44:16.000
♪You cross through pain
to reach the other shore♪

00:44:16.120 --> 00:44:19.460
♪You demand tears to come crashing down♪

00:44:19.620 --> 00:44:23.020
♪You demand old dreams
to grow into rainbows♪

00:44:23.020 --> 00:44:26.450
♪You demand dust
to stir up raging waves♪

00:44:26.560 --> 00:44:30.060
♪Souls will rise again♪

00:44:30.060 --> 00:44:33.410
♪You demand fate
turn generous from now on♪

00:44:33.540 --> 00:44:36.960
♪To return everything
it once took from you♪

00:44:36.960 --> 00:44:39.600
♪You demand tomorrow♪

00:44:39.600 --> 00:44:42.640
♪To bloom beyond the ruins♪

00:44:42.640 --> 00:44:44.330
♪The light will come♪

00:44:56.680 --> 00:45:00.440
♪Who keeps warmth alive♪

00:45:00.640 --> 00:45:03.510
♪And beholds
flowers bloom in the abyss?♪

00:45:03.680 --> 00:45:07.380
♪Who never stops calling out♪

00:45:07.380 --> 00:45:10.770
♪And finally opens their eyes♪

00:45:10.880 --> 00:45:13.830
♪From a long slumber?♪

00:45:13.940 --> 00:45:15.280
♪The light will come♪

00:45:15.280 --> 00:45:18.580
♪You demand to pass through
life's perils in peace♪

00:45:18.760 --> 00:45:22.140
♪You demand to decide your own fate♪

00:45:22.140 --> 00:45:24.790
♪You demand the future♪

00:45:24.790 --> 00:45:27.850
♪To flourish right before your eyes♪

00:45:27.850 --> 00:45:29.190
♪The light will come♪